### Android / Gradle build output ###
# No leading slash: this must match app/build/ as well as the root build/ directory.
build/
.gradle/
.kotlin/
.cxx/
.externalNativeBuild/
/captures

### Signing credentials — never commit these ###
# Losing the keystore means you can never publish an update existing users can install.
# Committing it means anyone can sign an APK that impersonates yours.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
*.bak
*scratch*

### Machine-specific ###
# Contains an absolute path to your local Android SDK.
local.properties

### IDE ###
/.idea
*.iml

### OS ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
